tory%3C/p%3E%0A%3Cp%3EFilename%3A%20filemanager/upload.php%3C/p%3E%0A%3Cp%3ELine%20Number%3A%2091%3C/p%3E%0A%0A%0A%09%3Cp%3EBacktrace%3A%3C/p%3E%0A%09%0A%09%09%0A%09%0A%09%09%0A%09%0A%09%09%0A%09%0A%09%09%0A%09%09%09%3Cp%20style%3D%22margin-left%3A10px%22%3E%0A%09%09%09File%3A%20/home/david/an-theme/admin/dist/filemanager/upload.php%3Cbr%20/%3E%0A%09%09%09Line%3A%2091%3Cbr%20/%3E%0A%09%09%09Function%3A%20chmod%09%09%09%3C/p%3E%0A%0A%09%09%0A%09%0A%0A%3C/div%3EWhatsApp%20Image%202020-10-13%20at%2019.25.03.jpeg\" alt=\"Alur Penggunaan Sistem\"><br><br>1. Mahasiswa perlu melakukan registrasi terlebih dahulu dengan klik tombol <strong>Login</strong> dan memilih <strong>Belum Punya Akun.</strong> Lalu isikan data NIM, Prodi, No HP dan Password yang sesuai.</p>\n<p><img src=\"%0A%3Cdiv%20style%3D%22border%3A1px%20solid%20%23990000%3Bpadding-left%3A20px%3Bmargin%3A0%200%2010px%200%3B%22%3E%0A%0A%3Ch4%3EA%20PHP%20Error%20was%20encountered%3C/h4%3E%0A%0A%3Cp%3ESeverity%3A%20Warning%3C/p%3E%0A%3Cp%3EMessage%3A%20%20move_uploaded_file(../../../../an-component/media/upload-gambar-pendukung/Screen%20Shot%202020-10-14%20at%2011.01.53.png)%3A%20failed%20to%20open%20stream%3A%20Permission%20denied%3C/p%3E%0A%3Cp%3EFilename%3A%20filemanager/upload.php%3C/p%3E%0A%3Cp%3ELine%20Number%3A%2090%3C/p%3E%0A%0A%0A%09%3Cp%3EBacktrace%3A%3C/p%3E%0A%09%0A%09%09%0A%09%0A%09%09%0A%09%0A%09%09%0A%09%0A%09%09%0A%09%09%09%3Cp%20style%3D%22margin-left%3A10px%22%3E%0A%09%09%09File%3A%20/home/david/an-theme/admin/dist/filemanager/upload.php%3Cbr%20/%3E%0A%09%09%09Line%3A%2090%3Cbr%20/%3E%0A%09%09%09Function%3A%20move_uploaded_file%09%09%09%3C/p%3E%0A%0A%09%09%0A%09%0A%0A%3C/div%3E%0A%3Cdiv%20style%3D%22border%3A1px%20solid%20%23990000%3Bpadding-left%3A20px%3Bmargin%3A0%200%2010px%200%3B%22%3E%0A%0A%3Ch4%3EA%20PHP%20Error%20was%20encountered%3C/h4%3E%0A%0A%3Cp%3ESeverity%3A%20Warning%3C/p%3E%0A%3Cp%3EMessage%3A%20%20move_uploaded_file()%3A%20Unable%20to%20move%20&singlequote;/tmp/phpFDOmP5&singlequote;